      "created_at": "2019-07-22T23:55:43Z",
      "updated_at": "2019-07-22T23:55:43Z",
      "body": "I'm going to resolve this - we got additional clarity from legal about where timing should live and the media removal from Mozilla servers is explicitly specified in there. Given the changes to the notice since this was opened a year ago, we'd ask for new considerations to be filed as a new issue. Also, by design, closing the room should now only ever happen if the room owner explicitly closes it.",
